Training uses <math id="S4.F7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T=240" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>240</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T=240</annotation></semantics></math> frames, and the unseen future extends to <math id="S4.F7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{\prime}=270" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>270</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{\prime}=270</annotation></semantics></math> frames. <span id="S4.F7.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">GT</span>: Ground Truth.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
