</span></div>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 8</span>: </span><span id="A2.T8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Comparing LPIPS (smaller is better) of smoke reconstruction by different methods on videos collected from FLAME <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">28</a>]</cite> and <a href="https://pixabay.com/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href ltx_framed ltx_framed_underline" style="--ltx-border-color:#000000;">Pixabay</a>.
</span></figcaption>
<div id="A2.T8.5" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:188.8pt;height:31.3pt;vertical-align:-14.4pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-90.1pt,14.9pt) scale(0.511754989367412,0.511754989367412) ;">
